---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Lowkeydevs"
  description="Read the Lowkeydevs Studio privacy commitment: how we handle client data, communications, and analytics."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="site-max pt-36 pb-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="text-12 text-[#8C52FF] font-bold block mb-4 tracking-widest uppercase">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="h2 font-tan mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-white/50">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert flex flex-col gap-8 text-15 text-white/80 leading-relaxed border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-20 font-bold text-[#ffffff] mb-3">1. Overview</h2>
        <p>Lowkeydevs ("we", "our", "us") values client and visitor privacy. This policy outlines how we handle information submitted through our agency consultation portal and browsing telemetry.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-20 font-bold text-[#ffffff] mb-3">2. Inbound Briefs and Contact Inquiries</h2>
        <p>When you submit a project brief or consultation request via our contact form, we collect your name, work email, company name, and project specifications. This data is strictly used to communicate with you regarding your engagement and is never sold or shared with external third-party advertisers.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-20 font-bold text-[#ffffff] mb-3">3. Telemetry and Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use Google Analytics 4 (GA4) with IP anonymization to monitor site traffic volume, page load performance, and user engagement trends. No personally identifiable information is stored in analytics logs.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-20 font-bold text-[#ffffff] mb-3">4. Security</h2>
        <p>Inbound consultation inquiries are secured in our PostgreSQL database protected by Row Level Security (RLS) policies and industry-standard encryption in transit and at rest.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-20 font-bold text-[#ffffff] mb-3">5. Contact</h2>
        <p>For inquiries regarding privacy or to request the deletion of your consultation data, contact <a href="mailto:hello@lowkeydevs.com" class="text-[#8C52FF] underline">hello@lowkeydevs.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
